### C1. Turn Pump A ON (single device)
POST http://localhost:5056/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{ "on": true, "sensorIds": ["PUMP-ID-HERE"] }

### C2. Turn ALL control devices OFF
POST http://localhost:5056/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{ "on": false }

### C3. Current device states
GET http://localhost:5056/commands/state

### C4. Command history (top of stack first)
GET http://localhost:5056/commands/history

### C5. Undo the last command
POST http://localhost:5056/commands/undo

### C6. Bad request: an electrical sensor ID or a random GUID
POST http://localhost:5056/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{ "on": true, "sensorIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"] }

### C7. Control telemetry (all the state changes, including undos)
GET http://localhost:5056/telemetry/control